  "description": "<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 1em; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, \"Lucida Grande\", sans-serif; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; caret-color: rgb(99, 115, 129); color: rgb(99, 115, 129); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: Barlow; font-size: 16px; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Our mission is to deliver high quality durable fashion accessories that are sustainable, look good and feels great.</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 1em; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, \"Lucida Grande\", sans-serif; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; caret-color: rgb(99, 115, 129); color: rgb(99, 115, 129); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: Barlow; font-size: 16px; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Our products are made from a mix of natural high-quality materials to deliver durability and style. Our eyewear range are lightweight to wear and available in a range of styles that are classic and unique in design.  </span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 1em; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, \"Lucida Grande\", sans-serif; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; caret-color: rgb(99, 115, 129); color: rgb(99, 115, 129); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: Barlow; font-size: 16px; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Our eyewear range includes three collections made using natural acetate resins, titanium & metal, and multi-layered natural woods. Uniquely designed to bring out your natural style, with classic styles that last.</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 1em; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, \"Lucida Grande\", sans-serif; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; caret-color: rgb(99, 115, 129); color: rgb(99, 115, 129); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: Barlow; font-size: 16px; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 1em; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, \"Lucida Grande\", sans-serif; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; caret-color: rgb(99, 115, 129); color: rgb(99, 115, 129);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: Barlow; font-size: 16px; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Our collections are handmade using a variety of sustainable materials and unique methods to attain the highest possible quality while retaining sustainable practices and ethical production.</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 1em; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, \"Lucida Grande\", sans-serif; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; caret-color: rgb(99, 115, 129); color: rgb(99, 115, 129); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: Barlow; font-size: 16px; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 1em; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, \"Lucida Grande\", sans-serif; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; caret-color: rgb(99, 115, 129); color: rgb(99, 115, 129);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: Barlow; font-size: 16px; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Our Wood<span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-size: 12px; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; position: relative; top: -0.5em;\">3 </span>technology is durable and unique in style, the Titanium range is tough and lightweight, and our Acetate collection are durable and lightweight</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 1em; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: Helvetica, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, \"Lucida Grande\", sans-serif; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; caret-color: rgb(99, 115, 129); color: rgb(99, 115, 129);\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: start; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Barlow; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit;\">We are a future focused business practices ensure we maintain ethical business and sustainable products for future generations. Our future focused ethics push us to create more sustainable business practices and continue to deliver products that look good, feel good and do good.</span>